      "summary": "The 2015 National University Strategic Plan outlines the University's commitment to adapt to the rapidly evolving landscape of higher education by focusing on academic excellence, personalized student services, and innovative use of technology. The plan emphasizes expanding program offerings, particularly online and flexible formats, while increasing enrollments among underserved populations including the military. As part of its goals, National University aims to be recognized for its leadership in online education and sustainability, backed by measurable outcomes such as a target of 40,000 FTE students and a $500 million endowment.",
